@startuml SEQ_02_MELIHAT_DAFTAR_ASET
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title SEQ-02 · Melihat Daftar Aset\nAktor: Kadep / Asisten (view-only, tanpa hak CRUD)

actor       "Kadep /\nAsisten"           as User
boundary    "Browser"   as Browser
control     "InventarisController"       as Controller
entity      "DetailAset Model"           as ModelDA
entity      "KategoriAset Model"         as ModelKA
database    "detail_aset"               as DB

note over User, DB : auth:sanctum + CheckLabAccess\nKadep \u2013 lihat semua lab (oversight)\nAsisten \u2013 lihat lab tempat mereka bertugas

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Lihat Daftar Aset ==
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

User    ->  Browser    : Buka menu Inventaris
Browser ->  Controller : GET /inventaris\n[can('viewAny', Inventaris)]

activate Controller
Controller -> ModelDA : with(['kategoriAset','inventaris'])\n.where('laboratorium_id', lab_id)\n.get()
activate ModelDA
ModelDA -> DB : SELECT detail_aset\n  JOIN inventaris, kategori_aset\nWHERE lab_id = ?
DB --> ModelDA : collection
deactivate ModelDA

Controller -> ModelKA : all()
ModelKA -> DB : SELECT kategori_aset
DB --> ModelKA : list
Controller --> Browser : Inertia::render('Inventaris', [aset, kategori, ...])\nnote: tombol Tambah/Edit/Hapus disembunyikan\nberbasis policy di frontend

Browser    --> User    : Tampilkan daftar aset (read-only)\n- Filter by kategori / kondisi\n- Kolom: nama, kondisi, kategori, lab\n- Tombol: Lihat Detail

deactivate Controller

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Lihat Detail Aset ==
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

User    ->  Browser    : Klik nama aset untuk lihat detail
Browser ->  Controller : GET /inventaris (sama, detail via modal/expand)\nOR via scan QR internal

activate Controller
Controller -> ModelDA : findOrFail(id).load([\n  'kategoriAset',\n  'laboratorium',\n  'riwayatKondisi' => order by created_at desc\n])
activate ModelDA
ModelDA -> DB : SELECT detail_aset + relasi WHERE id = ?
DB --> ModelDA : record + riwayat
deactivate ModelDA

Controller --> Browser : data detail aset + riwayat kondisi
Browser    --> User    : Tampilkan popup/panel detail:\n- Spesifikasi lengkap\n- Kondisi saat ini + riwayat kondisi\n- QR preview (tidak bisa download/regenerate)
deactivate Controller

@enduml
